<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">GROW YOUR GOOD BUSINESS</view><view class="heading-title">让好生意，从这里开始</view><view class="subtitle">简单入驻，即可开启你的商户经营台。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="field" wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="field-label">{{item.label}}</text><input value="{{form[item.key]}}" data-field="{{item.key}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="{{item.placeholder}}"/></view><view class="note">商户免审核开通。首次归属不会自动覆盖；演示有效邀请码为 JHY2026。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submitOnboarding" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">开通经营台</button></view></block></view>